      "widgets_values": [
        "A young woman with blonde hair takes a selfie while sipping an iced coffee on a city street at sunset.\n\nSubject: A fair-skinned young woman with wavy blonde hair and blue eyes looking directly at the camera.\n\nClothing: She wears a beige ribbed crop top, light-colored pants, and a light blue knitted cardigan draped over her shoulders.\n\nAction: She holds a clear plastic cup with a green straw to her lips, blowing a kiss or puckering her mouth slightly.\n\nEnvironment: An urban pedestrian street lined with modern buildings and trees, featuring a Starbucks storefront on the left and the CN Tower visible in the distance against the sky.\n\nCamera: A close-up selfie perspective with a shallow depth of field that blurs the background pedestrians and city lights.\n\nLighting: Warm golden hour sunlight from the setting sun creates a soft glow on her face and hair, contrasting with the ambient street lighting.\n\nText/Graphics: The green Starbucks logo is clearly visible on the cup she is holding.\n\nStyle Details: High-resolution photography with vibrant colors and a cinematic urban aesthetic."
